      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BAREFOOT JOHNNY (3) is in top form lately including a sharp win at this track in 19.83 two back then backing it up with a 19.75 victory at this track over 366m latest. Flying lately and looks hard to top. HARA'S MOSAIC (2) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (20.45) at this track behind Midnight Madness in a Grade 6. Settled off speed and worked to the line nicely. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings three times from three attempts. Bold showing expected. HARLEM RIPPLE (8) scored his maiden success two back then hit the frame last time when third and beaten 1.3 lengths at this track over 366m (20.63). Back to track where he won his maiden. Rates a leading chance again. AMALFI BLUE (4) will have admirers after surprising many with a placing last time out.",
